# Diagnostics owned by source planning and manifest validation.
#
# The planner is a compiler-independent package, so it cannot reuse the
# frontend token module's otherwise identical record. Consumers convert this
# shape explicitly at their rendering boundary instead of creating a package
# cycle or relying on a cross-package type alias.

## One planner diagnostic. `hint` is empty when there is none.
pub type Diag = { msg: String, lo: Int, hi: Int, hint: String }
